            <div xml:id="m-ffedd148-2c33-428a-ad8d-a1474b6baa4d">
              <lg xml:id="m-63f63674-dd45-410f-9731-0fad68b8e729">
                <l xml:id="m-ac48c1e3-a8da-422d-b6fd-c531fa82ade9" facs="#m-b3170e46-2800-4e96-a021-9fed8e5bcfb4" label="text-like">oth Sunday after the Epiphany.</l><l xml:id="m-2c30febf-0bc0-46c5-91a9-ca1d194a9829" facs="#m-7c26be1a-d801-4897-9211-8ecca09813ce" label="ambiguous">495</l><l xml:id="m-130ab590-4288-4129-9153-5c9e7efe9b93" facs="#m-8a784325-56e3-45e5-993a-db4adc58ee97" label="lyrics-like">sitis forma ómnibus credéntibus in! annúntiant qualem intróitum ha¬</l><l xml:id="m-7ba6b66d-cce3-4eb3-a472-22d8af4850c4" facs="#m-ae113f1e-4d0f-4f21-94cf-aa4545f098c5" label="lyrics-like">Macedónia, et in Acháia. A vobis</l><l xml:id="m-3c90e6b6-fc6b-44e9-b7fa-bb4aac7ea8dc" facs="#m-71f2e914-eac5-4eab-aa64-0fc8e3cd7a14" label="lyrics-like">buérimus ad vos: et quómodo con¬</l><l xml:id="m-591f470f-ac69-4e05-995b-a501987d85d0" facs="#m-249b9f64-ef54-421c-89a2-c540350de2bc" label="lyrics-like">vérsi estis ad Deum a simulácris,</l><l xml:id="m-7e149c02-7e35-472f-b977-8145c710e3dc" facs="#m-3039f522-3630-4258-8cc2-a428702698f8" label="lyrics-like">enim diffamátus est sermo Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-4c8cb285-10c2-4e32-83ab-4dcae357e536" facs="#m-26918239-c2e6-4ac8-b246-1c561ffaa36e" label="lyrics-like">non solum in Macedónia, et in</l><l xml:id="m-6573d164-d0e6-4a59-9878-ee4dbc5dccc9" facs="#m-0d149cb0-4ae7-4d6a-b7c5-e2e6c50a1613" label="ambiguous">servire Deo vivo et vero, et exspe¬</l><l xml:id="m-9ac92820-7e7b-4867-b6b8-027624413174" facs="#m-fffa732a-3d0b-405a-9918-0ded03464274" label="lyrics-like">Acháia, sed et in omni loco fides</l><l xml:id="m-e2442740-6da8-4103-bbd2-6de5bffa4be3" facs="#m-7501fb34-df6a-4230-a690-a40728e77e70" label="lyrics-like">ctáre Filium ejus de caelis (quem</l><l xml:id="m-c5ee3fe1-11b4-4a05-9640-4323980a1c5b" facs="#m-afc33ca0-5b9f-481e-9354-be626a74f353" label="lyrics-like">suscitávit ex mórtuis) Jesum, qui</l><l xml:id="m-db359123-6070-478f-bb05-f7caba102321" facs="#m-e6263c72-15ec-4460-a394-e9aa5b1116b4" label="lyrics-like">vestra, quae est ad Deum, profécta</l><l xml:id="m-d3b94b2c-31b4-4ac9-a3b4-965334e37d79" facs="#m-c193d4f7-23f9-4f16-bf32-0006979a91fd" label="lyrics-like">est, ita ut non sit nobis necésse</l><l xml:id="m-c31bc283-9887-45fa-b9cc-1de3f760f16e" facs="#m-061c369b-5178-46e8-b751-8c497202f7cd" label="lyrics-like">erípuit nos ab ira ventúra.</l><l xml:id="m-7ac17cf3-fea0-4b8e-94de-f70d6d21c52f" facs="#m-d3f37e0f-4a91-4c0e-a2b1-d9f1bbd6b6b2" label="ambiguous">quidquam loqui. Ipsi enim de nobis</l><l xml:id="m-c83aac17-5d51-4754-abee-defa44cb38c8" facs="#m-077de18a-7a0c-4f87-a3ad-03fcff53a211" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelil secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 13.</l><l xml:id="m-fad24ff3-36db-43f1-a773-cbf9b83e4349" facs="#m-ce24a09d-557a-42b3-ae4d-2e60fd52429c" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus turbis! ménto, quod accéptum múlier ab¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf68bf5a-fcde-4c23-9258-08d788cbb453" facs="#m-e47747c6-8237-4a57-9c95-dc7c115f740d" label="lyrics-like">L parábolam hanc: Símile est re¬</l><l xml:id="m-826f2617-14ba-4057-a549-5e0a55758666" facs="#m-70096029-a1c7-41e9-b85d-925593e2cff1" label="lyrics-like">cóndit in farinae satis tribus, donec</l><l xml:id="m-db26d6fa-0495-4f32-ad61-293f6b086fba" facs="#m-a2af375e-0b8b-4568-950d-2c8a9a930932" label="lyrics-like">fermentátum est totum. Haec ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-336d0112-2bb8-4b11-82d8-05fc53111ff9" facs="#m-adb475bb-2ba0-4d47-8191-7f1a4f205cc6" label="lyrics-like">gnum caelórum grano sinápis, quod</l><l xml:id="m-c7f14075-62b3-4556-a239-9346bc468dd0" facs="#m-e85c1f97-82dd-4d93-98f8-33e56665d65a" label="lyrics-like">accípiens homo seminávit in agro</l><l xml:id="m-6fbc67fb-8506-4e56-a410-4eab54991e74" facs="#m-2d03864e-f443-4727-a43a-768b1297c424" label="lyrics-like">locútus est Jesus in parábolis ad</l><l xml:id="m-98ba30be-bde2-439e-8da1-6bbffdf4567a" facs="#m-a68a56d8-2b4b-48dd-97af-dd39b6689561" label="lyrics-like">suo: quod mínimum quidem est</l><l xml:id="m-a75e29b2-0f6a-4f7a-8517-10b87d16ffbe" facs="#m-8cc8d238-144d-42ef-8df9-bf19beb4a741" label="lyrics-like">turbas: et sine parábolis non loque¬</l><l xml:id="m-374324a0-86cd-4ffb-b1c8-77d7d9a1c45c" facs="#m-98f83c37-3760-4b81-a983-2f61d3e13c65" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus semínibus: cum autem</l><l xml:id="m-927433d0-622e-4b28-a0f2-988259b9dab8" facs="#m-83d3e121-768c-4a01-8ba2-a06e8d19ade6" label="lyrics-like">bátur eis: ut implerétur quod di¬</l><l xml:id="m-fd249a2f-c4ad-4b1a-9046-02045733bee5" facs="#m-748e0216-41d4-452b-9312-9d611220865f" label="lyrics-like">créverit, majus est ómnibus oléri¬</l><l xml:id="m-7e15cc77-12c5-4266-9d25-13dfca432b6d" facs="#m-e8aebe58-9baf-4fe1-9ec3-36bb73bd5e02" label="lyrics-like">ctum erat per Prophétam dicéntem:</l><l xml:id="m-111b2cf8-c93d-44d5-916f-f96c19651346" facs="#m-02df6f42-5dda-4ba2-99fd-e13df329e78a" label="lyrics-like">Apériam in parábolis os meum, eru¬</l><l xml:id="m-786418cc-ad7d-4192-8094-f00900ed48ec" facs="#m-f803fbf5-f20d-45d5-a390-c14bb9ebf31a" label="lyrics-like">bus, et fit arbor, ita ut vólucres caeli</l><l xml:id="m-c019e64a-1271-4851-856f-bd3c50344355" facs="#m-a858efc1-c1ea-44de-bf41-b0f4558049e5" label="lyrics-like">véniant, et hábitent in ramis ejus.</l><l xml:id="m-cd44dd91-b2fd-45d8-b5c0-f45aa5453b82" facs="#m-39a5b11a-b510-4645-8f2d-2aa1ef4a4063" label="lyrics-like">ctábo abscôndita a constitutióne</l><l xml:id="m-f4508df7-91bf-4d54-97ad-618f7ca49a06" facs="#m-cf91be25-f501-45d1-b6eb-22d96f1cd840" label="lyrics-like">Aliam parábolam locútus est eis:</l><l xml:id="m-f9981a57-5124-4560-bbac-f67404db1960" facs="#m-10ab6ac3-423b-49be-8f5d-bc58bec367a7" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-ba223a3a-16a3-4e82-9901-c98130c10d05" facs="#m-09745f9a-1efc-4605-9b28-5cfa5f29460e" label="ambiguous">mundi.</l><l xml:id="m-ed84be40-b8aa-45f0-9227-245c15d18bde" facs="#m-1f8c2d17-3357-4f07-82ce-84cedcbfb3e0" label="lyrics-like">Simile est regnum caelórum fer¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae1fb170-b417-4e31-b671-b77fd5331e60" facs="#m-82d86b7b-b57c-4761-a611-2054e15bd77c" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-deb626b5-454f-4dab-a016-be98fb320851" facs="#m-775aaa5f-705c-4c64-82b4-aef4e8fa10af" label="lyrics-like">Aec nos oblátio Deus mundet, net, et prótegat. Per Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-e6a2a6f4-183e-4597-9114-0df742414c61" facs="#m-f6e2d4eb-05a4-4717-bd8e-d010d1ad789c" label="lyrics-like">Il quaésumus, et rénovet, gubér-l nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-6631f982-cfe2-4bb1-b106-64aa099bccfa" facs="#m-8001cda4-3c62-435f-b846-c1aa531b3374" label="lyrics-like">Second Secret. Exáudi nos. p. S0l. Third at the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-38970b57-7559-4eb4-a792-edd5c98aa15d" facs="#m-7fe7aa8f-1cbf-49e2-9b1c-4f818afe15d6" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-65c24cde-4ef6-4d50-b28b-f7b910bcd021" facs="#m-96ee3e71-de52-43b7-a289-7ee8b81b5758" label="lyrics-like">vAeléstibus, Dómine, pasti deli- dem, per quae veráciter vivimus,</l><l xml:id="m-fa743388-9b96-488d-a446-560a8a356629" facs="#m-692463b8-df56-4316-afb0-9354172df6ac" label="lyrics-like">Lciis: quaésumus; ut semper éa¬ appetámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2dd90ec6-3f70-4a32-9961-d723c3329d8b" facs="#m-292365bb-9e69-4efc-8b56-6730a0eeaeaf" label="lyrics-like">Second Postcommunion. Mundet et múniat. p. 502. Third at the priest'e</l><l xml:id="m-0e8b4f23-ed61-4c6f-85d0-a6669753c466" facs="#m-4ddb5563-9aa2-4241-840c-1c3b4055f329" label="ambiguous">choice.</l><l xml:id="m-67a82301-41d8-4168-a746-4c5e0672924c" facs="#m-2a355f60-a8df-4565-af3b-3906dce6bb79" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-98eefbeb-cd10-48bf-8fc5-f56c773635f2" facs="#m-9ec5f158-8293-4422-967b-f459001ee20b" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-5c639b7b-f4d3-4e42-8e84-a0ed40839b33" facs="#m-08943d5f-5d90-4417-ac2b-a15945160ed2" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.a3</l><l xml:id="m-654ffca8-66bc-4a7b-b58f-c9def1ce49b6" facs="#m-61f6c47c-00c4-49f3-9f0a-3ec042ad43e2" label="ambiguous">2</l><l xml:id="m-e189ed77-63bd-4875-ace0-a4a41f7dab21" facs="#m-967d5f8b-0eb7-4181-910d-cdcebc1d8805" label="lyrics-like">Imi-le est “ régnum caelórum ferménto, quod</l><l xml:id="m-316fc777-07c7-41e9-8977-be3de29a9c7d" facs="#m-28f58074-9e22-48f1-9bb3-ca7e6be9c866" label="lyrics-like">accéptum mú-li-er abscóndit in fa-rinae sá-tis tribus, do¬</l><l xml:id="m-cb756300-225b-42d4-88a7-0d43f7002d11" facs="#m-4d26c998-d367-41ac-b548-cb1fde8c7edb" label="lyrics-like">nec fermentá-tum est tó-tum. E u o u a e.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>